{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1562302-forces-4-and-division-of-successes","id":1562302,"title":"Forces 4 and Division of Successes","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2026-07-29T07:21:37-07:00","id":1562302,"title":"Forces 4 and Division of Successes","content":"Hello.<br /> <br /> I was wondering how the division of successes rule would work with Forces 4, given the fact the M20 book emphasizes &quot;scale&quot; as the main change vs Forces 3.<br /> <br /> Would that mean every success spent on damage does more damage?<br /> Every one spent on duration makes the effect last longer?<br /> Every one spent on targets affects more than one additional target?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5394-argonot","name":"Argonot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5394_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"227"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-07-29T08:18:21-07:00","id":1562305,"title":"","content":"As far as I'm aware the division of success rule, when it is applicable, would be exactly the same. However, in some cases a large enough effect will make some of those options unnecessary. Number of targets in particular should only come into play if the spell is directed against those specific targets, just creating a firestorm that burns everything in an area doesn't require spending points on targets. The increased scale of Forces 4 lends itself more to area of effect spells anyways so I'd anticipate most Forces 4 spells don't need to spend successes on targeting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: The Ice-ension: An Epic Game of Reality on the Rink","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/758-ramnesis","name":"Ramnesis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar758_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2220"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}